<view class="app theme-{{theme}}"><view class="wrap"><view class="h2" style="padding-top:20px">我的米其林结算</view><view class="sub">一张长图，收藏每一餐的味觉记忆。</view><view class="recap-range"><view wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="key" class="{{range===item.key?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectRange">{{item.name}}</view></view><image wx:if="{{image}}" class="recap-preview" src="{{image}}" mode="widthFix" bindtap="preview"/><view class="share-actions"><view class="btn" bindtap="preview">查看大图</view><view class="btn primary" bindtap="save">保存图片</view></view><canvas type="2d" id="recapCanvas" style="position:fixed;left:-2000px;top:0;width:375px;height:600px"/></view></view>
